WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.603
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show" here...

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.737
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.706
...Studio 6A in New York City.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.775
Thank you, Roots.
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.611
Well, guys,
as of this afternoon,

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.713
some states are still
counting their votes,

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.449
but the numbers are looking good
for Joe Biden.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.817
Yep, it seems like America --

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.953
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:22.589
Seems like America is just about
ready

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:24.691
to socially distance
from President Trump.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:27.127
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.063
Yep, as more votes
came in today,

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.865
the coronavirus
put on its hat and coat

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:34.633
and thought,
"Well, it's been a good run.

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.136
Good day to you all."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.537
That's right, as of now,
it's looking like

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:41.908
the GOP strategy of "Hope no one
notices the global pandemic"

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.176
didn't turn out so well.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:47.046
At this very moment, Biden is
smiling from ear to ear.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.981
At least I think he is.
It's hard to tell

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.517
since he's wearing a mask!

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.819
You should wear a --

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:55.254
You could tell
Biden's feeling good, though.

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.622
He spent most of the day

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:59.125
putting the finishing screw-ups
on his acceptance speech.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:02.195
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.230
Later, Biden was seen
swigging Ocean Spray

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.633
while hanging off the back
of an Amtrak train.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:11.637
♪ Thunder only happens
when it's raining ♪

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:13.406
♪♪

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.176
Was he drinking while singing?
I don't know what he --

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.044
Well, he's going so fast
that there's no liquid --

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.079
-Right, exactly.
-It's a lot of space work,

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:22.615
but trust me, it makes sense.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.150
Here's how confident
Biden is feeling.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.618
He just called Trump to say,

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.586
"Hey, that crap
about Hunter's laptop?

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.756
All true. Bye!"

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:33.192
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:35.361
What you gonna do?

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.364
Yeah, the only people happier
than Biden's staff is Trump's.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.233
"Oh, my God. It's almost over.
Thank goodness.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:44.603
Gosh, that was
a long four years."

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:46.239
I'm not saying
Trump is in trouble,

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:49.776
but he was just sent straight to
voicemail by the MyPillow guy.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:53.812
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:55.514
But this is nice --
Trump's inner circle

00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:56.883
is trying to cheer him up.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.519
They're like, "Yes, you may be
losing the White House,

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:00.853
but on the bright side,
you can now focus

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:03.056
on that cool billion you owe."

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:05.124
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:08.027
Meanwhile, Eric Trump was like,
"If Biden is president,

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.630
does that mean he's my new dad?"

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.732
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.732 --> 00:02:15.067
Yep, nothing is definite,

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.570
but the outcome feels
pretty inevitable right now.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.305
Vladimir Putin is like,
"Oh, well.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.207
You rig some, you lose some."

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:25.311
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:29.348
You rig some, you lose some.
Trending on Twitter right now.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.083
That's right, things are looking
pretty good for Biden,

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.618
but we're still waiting
for a final call,

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:35.588
'cause a few swing states
are still counting final votes.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.889
Seriously,
this is getting crazy.

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:39.091
It's like we're living through
that dramatic pause

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:41.760
before they give out a rose
on "The Bachelorette,"

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.095
but for two full days.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:44.329
You're like, "Okay --

00:02:44.329 --> 00:02:45.832
[ Breathing heavily ]

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:48.634
Okay-y-y-y.
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.236
[ Drum roll stops ]

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.371
Ah...
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:55.641
Will you accept -- Eh..."

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:57.977
At this point,
Americans are like, "Let's go.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.980
We've got no things to do,
and no people to see."

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.617
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.486
I heard Zog's laugh at it.
That's --

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.420
[ Laughter ]
But this is interesting.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.124
I heard that each ballot
is processed by two volunteers,

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.624
one Democrat and one Republican.

00:03:12.624 --> 00:03:13.993
And if they fall in love,

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.462
they star in a Hallmark movie
called "Count on Love."

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.398
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.966
Imagine being
a ballot counter, though.

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.801
You're stuck inside
a room full of people

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.670
during a global pandemic,
paper cuts all over your hands,

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:25.905
and the rest of the country
is like,

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:28.374
"What the hell
is taking so long?!

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.710
I don't hear any counting
in there, Gretchen."

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.778
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.247
-Gretchen.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.215
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:38.484
It would be a Gretchen.
-It feels like it, right?

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.653
You can tell Trump's starting
to panic about the results,

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:43.755
'cause this morning,
he tweeted, "STOP THE COUNT!"

00:03:43.755 --> 00:03:46.626
In response, The Count
from "Sesame Street" tweeted,

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:49.696
"You've lost ONE, TWO, THREE
swing states!

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.664
AH AH AH"

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:54.566
♪♪

00:03:54.566 --> 00:03:56.335
Then a little later in the day,

00:03:56.335 --> 00:03:59.638
Trump also tweeted,
"STOP THE FRAUD!"

00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:02.975
Yeah, "STOP THE COUNT!"
then "STOP THE FRAUD!"

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.878
Soon he's going to tell us to
stop, collaborate, and listen.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.546
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:10.450
♪♪

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.150
What -- I was trying
to do his dance move,

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:14.020
but does he have a --

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.222
Oh, yeah, it was.
It was a lot of --

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:18.290
-A lot of --

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.793
-A lot of, like, chain flying?

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.995
♪♪

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:24.263
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:25.398
-It's not skipping rope.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:27.033
-I'm skipping rope,
but still, it's --

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:30.269
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.269 --> 00:04:31.971
-Wait, do it again.
Do it again. Do it again.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.406
♪♪

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:35.908
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:37.510
-I'm double dutching.
I'm double dutching.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.879
I don't know what I'm doing.
Sorry, Vanilla.

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:41.080
Sorry.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.381
But he's not just tweeting.

00:04:42.381 --> 00:04:45.117
Trump's campaign started
taking legal action yesterday.

00:04:45.117 --> 00:04:46.185
Check it out.

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:48.621
-Legal challenges
are already under way.

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:51.924
The Trump campaign has filed
lawsuits in Pennsylvania,

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:54.894
Michigan, and Georgia,
and the campaign is pursuing

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:57.796
a recount of the vote
in Wisconsin.

00:04:57.796 --> 00:04:59.465
-You know you're in trouble
when your master plan

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:02.234
starts with, "Get me
Rudy Giuliani on the phone."

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:04.804
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, as we speak,

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:06.605
Trump is assembling
a dream team of lawyers

00:05:06.605 --> 00:05:09.208
who all claim they were
tucking in their shirts.

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.345
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:14.013
Of course --

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:15.548
Of course he's suing.
I get the feeling

00:05:15.548 --> 00:05:17.383
when Trump didn't get
the Christmas gift he wanted

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.186
as a kid, he was like,
"Better lawyer up, Nana.

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:21.987
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.987 --> 00:05:24.624
Better lawyer up, Nana."

00:05:24.624 --> 00:05:26.926
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:29.094
Trending on Twitter.
That's a good one.

00:05:29.094 --> 00:05:31.197
"Better lawyer up, Nana."

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:32.531
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.531 --> 00:05:34.133
Meanwhile, I read
that Trump is upset

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:37.570
that Fox News called Arizona
for Biden on election night.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.504
And yesterday, Trump's
supporters came to his defense.

00:05:39.504 --> 00:05:40.973
Listen to this.

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:43.009 line:0%
-[ Chanting ] Fox News sucks!
-[ Chanting ] Fox News sucks!

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:46.779 line:0%
-And they're actually chanting
"Fox News sucks.

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:48.714 line:0%
Fox News sucks."

00:05:48.714 --> 00:05:50.182
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.182 --> 00:05:51.550
Trump's supporters were like,

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.421
"We only trust one real news
outlet -- Facebook memes."

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:57.223
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.223 --> 00:05:58.724
You can tell
everyone is on edge.

00:05:58.724 --> 00:06:01.227
Sean Hannity just had
an unscaleable wall built

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:04.396
around his studio.

00:06:04.396 --> 00:06:05.765
♪♪

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:07.466
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.466 --> 00:06:09.001
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.237
♪♪

00:06:11.237 --> 00:06:12.939
It's "DeShay"?

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:14.940
DeShay revolves it?
-Yep.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.576
-It's DeShay, right?

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:17.710
Yeah.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.811
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.679
That was a really loud "Yep"
from Mark.

00:06:20.679 --> 00:06:22.181
-How'd he --
Yeah, how'd he know that?

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:23.615
-The rest of The Roots
just looked at me.

00:06:23.615 --> 00:06:27.420
Mark goes, "Yep.
That's right, it's DeShay."

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.521
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.521 --> 00:06:30.889
Wow.

00:06:30.889 --> 00:06:32.425
"Check out the hook
while DeShay revolves it."

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:33.859
-Oh, my God.

00:06:33.859 --> 00:06:35.962
-Yo, I never --
I thought he said "deejay."

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:37.429
-Nah.

00:06:37.429 --> 00:06:39.498
-I thought it was, "Check out
the hook while my deejay re--"

00:06:39.498 --> 00:06:41.901
But, yeah.
-No, you'd think that.

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.203
-Yeah, one would think.
-One would.

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:46.238
-Yeah.
-And one wouldn't, you know?

00:06:46.238 --> 00:06:48.307
-Yep, yep.

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.941
You rig some, you lose some.

00:06:49.941 --> 00:06:52.578
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:53.912
-That's right.

00:06:53.912 --> 00:06:55.982
"Better lawyer up, Nana."

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:58.084
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.985
Oh, and here's something
you don't hear every day.

00:06:59.985 --> 00:07:02.821
A man was banned from
Yellowstone National Park

00:07:02.821 --> 00:07:05.424
for trying to fry chickens
in the hot spring.

00:07:05.424 --> 00:07:08.193
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.193 --> 00:07:10.963
You see, these are
the stories we can focus on

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:13.599
during a Biden presidency.

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:16.102
Not Trump.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:16.102 --> 00:07:18.303
Fried chickens in the hot --

00:07:18.303 --> 00:07:20.772
I'm too lazy
to microwave a Lean Cuisine.

00:07:20.772 --> 00:07:23.242
This guy goes to Wyoming
to cook a 12-piece.

00:07:23.242 --> 00:07:24.310
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.478
Here's a big business story --

00:07:25.478 --> 00:07:27.679
The owner of Arby's
and Buffalo Wild Wings

00:07:27.679 --> 00:07:31.450
is buying Dunkin' Donuts
and Baskin-Robbins.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:35.254
Wow, they now have a monopoly
on clogged arteries.

00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:37.690
Here's the plan -- Dunkin' for
breakfast, Arby's for lunch,

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.559
Buffalo Wild Wings for dinner,
Baskin-Robbins for dessert,

00:07:40.559 --> 00:07:42.862
then you drop your kids back off
at their mother's house.

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:44.563
[ Laughter ]

00:07:44.563 --> 00:07:46.699
"I'm dating again, Susan."

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:50.702
[ Laughter ]

00:07:50.702 --> 00:07:52.905
And finally, a car in Wisconsin
was just pulled over

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:55.007
for a pretty interesting reason.
Watch this.

00:07:55.007 --> 00:07:57.076
-The state trooper
had pulled over a driver

00:07:57.076 --> 00:07:58.944
who thought it was a good idea

00:07:58.944 --> 00:08:01.947 line:0%
to strap a snowmobile
to the top of his car.

00:08:01.947 --> 00:08:05.217 line:0%
The 23-year-old driver explained
that it, "looked sketchy,"

00:08:05.217 --> 00:08:07.119 line:0%
but said that
he strapped it down

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:09.455 line:0%
and he shook it
to make sure it was secure.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.490
[ Laughter ]

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:12.691
-In his defense, that's how

00:08:12.691 --> 00:08:15.194
every New Yorker installs
an air conditioner. Yeah.

